          "retained": [
            "Replace string fragment storage and strcat/atol work with contiguous uint32_t arrays and one-time left*10^7 scaling.",
            "Keep a scaled left value in the outer loop and stream the suffix array in the inner loop; use a local insertion sort for the bounded output set.",
            "Replace sqrtl/fmod trial division with overflow-safe 64-bit modular exponentiation, deterministic Miller-Rabin bases {2,7,61}, and a small-prime prefilter."
